sequenceDiagram
    participant Mic as AudioRecord
    participant Sess as CaptionSession
    participant Vad as EnergyVad
    participant Asr as StreamingAsrEngine
    participant Cap as CaptionAggregator
    participant Ui as SpeechCaptionActivity

    Mic->>Sess: 100ms PCM bytes
    Sess->>Sess: bytesToFloatMono
    Sess->>Vad: rms
    Sess->>Ui: onLevel rms speaking
    Sess->>Asr: acceptWaveform float
    Asr->>Asr: decode while ready
    alt 文本变化
        Asr->>Cap: Partial
        Cap->>Ui: 覆盖当前一句
    end
    alt endpoint 或文件结束
        Asr->>Cap: Final
        Cap->>Ui: 追加已确认句子
        Asr->>Asr: reset stream
    end
